@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Cloudflare Agents runtime
+
+Keep each registered `AIChatAgent` class exported by the Worker entry point and declare its Durable Object binding in the Worker configuration. Add each first deployment to a SQLite Durable Object migration with `new_sqlite_classes`, configure the model provider binding or secret used by the selected model, and deploy Worker code, bindings, and migrations together.
+
+To close the support tool boundary statically, replace the runtime tool spread with a closed explicit `tools` object at the direct generation call. To close step-support instruction provenance statically, remove the `prepareStep` instruction replacement and load the canonical instruction through a repository-local loader at the direct generation call.
